## Scope and sources

- v1 is AGCC-only. Sources: RD (PDF + MTO XLSX + SOURCE_EDITABLE), SQ (PDF + MTO XLSX, no overlay, no SOURCE_EDITABLE), and `_ГОТОВЫЕ_ДЛЯ_РОБОТА` (MTO XLSX).
- RD scan collects: PDF; MTO XLSX (name contains `mto`/`мто`, whole RD walk); SOURCE_EDITABLE (`dwg`, non-MTO `xlsx`/`xls`, `doc`/`docx`, `zip`/`7z`/`7zip`) when the folder is a package media folder (`PDF` / `DWG` / `BBB` / `ПДФ`, case-insensitive), or the folder also contains a `.pdf`, **or the folder is the canonical issued `NN_…` package itself** (BOE/BOM/BOQ xlsx next to MTO without a PDF sibling; 7560-SKUD `04_рев.0-AN02`). After the AGCC mask, **RD stores only canonical issued paths** (`title/mark/gate/NN_/[PDF|DWG|BBB|ПДФ]`). Non-canonical AGCC files are skipped the same way as a non-AGCC name: not in the DB, not in collisions, not in «Все документы». Previously stored non-canonical rows are **deleted** (`CatalogDatabase.purge_noncanonical_rd_files`) on startup hydrate unless `schema_meta.noncanonical_rd_clean=1` (not kept as `present=0`). A reliable RD `store_scan` only clears that flag (no full RD-path walk in the scan worker); robot-only and unreliable RD scans leave the flag. The next start after an RD scan walks once (usually 0 deletes) and sets the flag again. Canonical RD that vanished from disk stays `present=0` + PENDING until review. SQ scan collects PDF and MTO XLSX in any folder under `sq_root` (no SOURCE_EDITABLE, no overlay, no issued-path filter). Transmittal-style names (`SQ-PP-AGCC-KSB-00051-0_signed.pdf`) and other non-AGCC files are skipped: not in the DB, not in collisions, not in «Все документы».
- MTO xlsx is still a source/editable in the documents GUI («Ред»); robot MTO comparison is an extra contour, not a different file nature.
- SOURCE_EDITABLE never joins PDF/MTO overlay.
- Never write to RD/SQ UNC sources except the user-confirmed kits action «Перенести SQ в РД». Runtime DB/config live under `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Documentation_PDF_out_NK\rd_catalog\`.
- User-initiated kits action may copy the newest **official** overlay-current RD/SQ MTO into `robot_root` after confirmation (not a working revision). The previous robot file is moved to `_old_<stem>_YYYY.MM.DD_HH.MM` in the same folder (robot scanner already skips substring `old`).
- User-initiated kits action «Перенести SQ в РД (новая передача)» may **move** the SQ title+mark folder into a new issued transfer under the existing RD mark / gate (`Для передачи` / `На_отправку` / …). Folder name: ``NN_рев.<filename-rev>_от_YYYY.MM.DD`` (`NN` = next sequence under the gate, date = local mtime of the newest file in the SQ folder). Creates `title / MARK / Для передачи` only when that tree is missing. SQ root itself is never moved. Destination must stay under `rd_root` and outside `sq_root`. After success the GUI rescans the **RD gate folder** (`Для передачи` / sibling transfers of the kit, not only the new ``NN_рев``) and the **SQ kit folder** (`rd_subtree` / `sq_subtree`) and stays on Комплекты.
- Normalize Unicode dashes (including U+2010) before parsing, but retain original names/paths for display.
- RD/SQ `os.walk` prunes `skip_dirs` by case-insensitive substring of **directory names** (not filenames) **during the UNC scan**: matching children are dropped from `dirs[:]` so those subtrees are not walked, statted, or parsed. Factory template: [`rd_catalog/default_config.json`](rd_catalog/default_config.json) (`пример`, `сравнение`, `ePlan`, `МДЗ`, `Замечания`, `Comment Attachments`, …). Working list is always `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Documentation_PDF_out_NK\rd_catalog\skip_dirs.json` ([`rd_catalog/skip_dirs.py`](rd_catalog/skip_dirs.py)). If that file is missing or corrupt, it is rewritten from the packaged template (no GUI «заводской список»). `load_config` stays side-effect-free: reads the runtime file when valid, else packaged tokens, and does not write. Empty `tokens` = skip nothing. Tokens that would match a transfer gate (`Для передачи`, `Для_передачи`, `На_отправку`, `На_передачу`) are rejected. Do not use short tokens that hit issued transfers (`раб`, `ид`, `as-build`).

## Parsing and keys

- Reuse `utils.file_name_converts.AgccFilenamePatterns`; do not duplicate filename regex or fall back to legacy `getDocTitle/getMarkaFromFileName`.
- `title_system` splits once into title and mark; `discipline_block` identifies document type/number; `split_revision_tail` yields file revision/AN/language/ext.
- Use `parse_agcc_mto_xlsx_revision_for_chain` for MTO revision chains.
- PDF key: normalized `core_stem`. MTO key: `(title_system, discipline_block)`. SOURCE_EDITABLE uses the same `AgccFilenamePatterns` / `core_stem` as PDF; do not duplicate regex.
- Pair PDF↔editable when title/mark/revision/`core_stem` match AND (same folder OR editable in `DWG` one level above the PDF folder OR `DWG` inside the PDF folder). Otherwise the editable is a separate not-transferred row (`PDF=no`).
- **Канонический путь РД:** `rd_root / <титул 4 цифры> / <папка марки> / <шлюз> / <NN_…> / [PDF|DWG|BBB|ПДФ] / файл`. Пример: `РД\9110\06_KSB_21\Для передачи\05_рев.0-AN02_AGCC.287-9110-KSB1\PDF\AGCC.287-9110-KSB1.OD-0001_0-AN02_RU.pdf`. Шлюз — имя с ``передач`` / ``отправк`` (обычно ``Для передачи``; также ``Для_передачи``, ``На_отправку``, ``На_передачу``). Папка марки может быть ``KSB1`` или ``06_KSB_21``. Файлы могут лежать прямо в ``NN_…``, без ``PDF``/``DWG``/``BBB``/``ПДФ``. Хелперы: `has_canonical_rd_issued_path`, `is_package_media_folder`, `issued_package_dir`, `kit_rd_mark_folder_from_path`.
- Transfer **gate** is a path segment whose name contains ``передач`` or ``отправк`` (``Для передачи``, ``Для_передачи``, ``На_отправку``, ``На_передачу``, ``03_Для передачи``, ``2025.12.08_Для передачи``, …). Issued packages live under **title / mark / gate / ``NN_…``**. Files sit in ``PDF`` / ``DWG`` / ``BBB`` / ``ПДФ`` inside that package, or directly in the ``NN_…`` folder.
- Under a gate, a child folder is an issued transfer iff the name starts with 1–2 digits (``10_рев.AN01_…``, ``10_рев.04_…``, ``01``). **Nothing after those digits decides inclusion.** Mark folders (``12_POS1``, ``11_SPP``) are not transfers: they are not under a gate. Title folders (``8950``) are never transfers.
- Outside a gate, keep the legacy name shape (``NN`` / ``NN_рев.<digit>``) so packages without a gate folder still overlay. ``рев.AN01`` without a digit after ``рев.`` is a transfer **only** under a gate.
- Kit / transfer / tree revision text is the **filename** revision/AN of overlay-current files, never folder ``рев.*``. Rank: highest filename revision; **OD wins ties**. Numeric tokens outrank ``V``/``S``; ``S`` outranks ``V``. Folder names are sequenced only by the leading ``NN`` (later ``11`` may repeat the same file revision as ``10`` when reviewers do not bump AN). Snapshot ``paths`` are newest-first (highest sequence, then filename rev, OD, PDF before MTO xlsx). Kits open/copy use official-current ``paths[0]`` (working package excluded, including leftover files still named as the official rev). Documents-tree open folder is the selected node.

## As-build

As-build is an ordinary later RD issuance, **not** a skip-dir and **not** a separate overlay. Canonical file flag `is_as_build` (persisted on `file_entry.transfer_is_as_build`) is true when **any** of: transfer-folder name matches `_AS_BUILD_RE`; any **directory** segment of the file path matches the same regex (`as-built` / `as-build` / `исполнительн…`). Filename AGCC tokens do not encode as-build. Google F `us_build` (US-BUILD) is journal-only: letter `AB` on that event’s revision in the MTO revision matrix; it does **not** change `KitPipelineStatus`. Do not add skip token `as-build` (it would prune issued transfers). Overlay `detected_current` still includes as-build packages. Filter «последние без as-build» / `is_current_ifc` = highest filename revision among **present RD files with `is_as_build=0`** (OD wins ties); it does not rewrite overlay. Kits RD-rev cell suffix `AB` when the **official** snapshot is as-build; tooltip names the latest IFC revision. «Рабочая рев. РД» gets the same suffix when the **working** folder is as-build (`pipeline.working_as_build`). Issued as-build that **matches** last send stays official with `(AB)` (5500-style), not working. Documents-tree checkbox **As-build** (`window/doc_tree_show_as_build`, default off). History column **AB** after «Рев.»; **«Статус MTO»** after AB. MTO readiness keeps «As-built» plus filter «Без as-build». Details: [AI_rd_catalog_db.mdc](.cursor/rules/AI_rd_catalog_db.mdc).

## Ревизии MTO (heatmap)

Tab **«Ревизии MTO»** immediately after Комплекты: rows = `(title, mark)` that also appear on **«Все документы»** (present files, skip-dirs hidden, banned hidden). Google/issuance-only kits without catalog files are omitted. Columns = union of filename revisions (`revision_rank`). Cells from `list_revision_matrix` only (no F/CSV parse in the widget). Ban/unban and skip-dir edits refresh this tab (`_apply_ban_visibility` / `_sync_skip_dirs_from_store`). Fill = per-revision pipeline (`empty` / `no_mto` / `not_uploaded` / `sent_tdo` / `tdo_review` / `code_a|b|c` / `working`); letters `A`/`B`/`C`/`T`/`W`/`–` plus `AB`; problem border from `problem_kinds`. Heatmap **keeps** `working` / `W` cells. Jump to Комплекты is **only** the context action «Показать в „Комплекты“»; cell click/double-click does not navigate. Header click sorts any column (numeric titles, `revision_rank` for «РД · рев.» / «Авто МТО», compare-kind order for «Сверка Авто МТО»); first paint stays title/mark order; sort is not persisted. Fixed columns: Титул | Марка | В папку робота | **РД · рев.** (official filename rev via `set_export_records` + `official_detected_current_ids` / `aggregate_source_kits`, suffix ` AB`, tooltip names latest IFC) | **Авто МТО** (customer PI vs the export/robot file) | **Сверка Авто МТО** (content compare vs that same file: official RD, or the manual pin; green for `четкое` / `ПоКоду и Кол-ву` / **`рев. совпала`**, yellow for `не совпало` / `другой файл`). Filename-revision columns start at index 6. READY/WARNING stays on «MTO · Готовность». Heatmap answers which revisions exist. Palette extra keys live in `status_colors.json`. Compact Russian badges: `STATUS_SHORT_LABELS` / `status_short_label` in [`rd_catalog/status_colors.py`](rd_catalog/status_colors.py) (documents tree + worklist; fallback `status_color_label`).

Tab **«MTO · Перечень»** ([`rd_catalog/mto_worklist_tab.py`](rd_catalog/mto_worklist_tab.py)) immediately after «Ревизии MTO»: flat per-revision list from `list_mto_worklist` — which MTO files to go and fix. `list_mto_worklist` skips `pipeline_status == "working"` **after** `cell_keys.add`, so the kit is not synthesized as `no_rd`. 16 columns: Титул | Марка | Ревизия (F/РД) | Этап ревизии | Метки | **Связь F → РД → MTO** | Google | AB | Ручной выбор MTO | **Сверка Авто МТО** | Файл MTO | Дата MTO | Пакет | Чего не хватает | Проблемы | Путь MTO. `status`/`letters` stay the per-revision Google F pipeline (`code_a` can exist without a folder). The link column is `F✓/✗ · РД✓/✗ · MTO✓/✗` and splits the F journal from physical package/MTO paths; tooltip explains that gap. Status cell uses the heatmap palette; bold on `problem_kinds` **or** `gap_kind` (`no_package` / `no_mto_file` / `no_rd`); underline on `is_current`; «Чего не хватает» foreground uses `problem`. «Google» reads `нет комплекта` (not in КСБ ИД and not in Выдача) / `нет статуса` (kit known, no F event or send on this revision) / `есть`; the first two use the `problem` foreground. «Проблемы» renders `collision_kind_label` (Russian); the raw tokens stay searchable. Filters (AND, hide rows) persist `window/mto_worklist_*`: Код A, Прошли ТДО (`_TDO_STATUSES` from [`rd_catalog/revision_matrix_tab.py`](rd_catalog/revision_matrix_tab.py) so the two tabs cannot drift), Только текущие, Только последние IFC on the first row; Нет MTO, Нет в РД, Нет в Google, Без статуса F, Только проблемы, Без as-build, Только as-build on the second, plus text. A heatmap kit can vanish here when those boxes stay on (Код A ∧ ТДО keeps only `code_a`; a TDO-only kit such as 1757 POS stays on «Ревизии MTO»). The coverage line `Строки: n / N` is the hint. Two header labels: bold coverage `Титулы: n / N · Комплекты: n / N · Строки: n / N` (denominators are all loaded rows, numerators the visible ones; totals cached in `_rebuild_table`) and a breakdown `Код A · ТДО · Нет MTO · Нет в РД · Нет в Google · Без статуса F · Проблемы`. Legend uses the same palette keys. The tab follows the **Комплекты** universe: ban filter only (`allowed_kits=None`), deliberately **not** «Все документы» membership — that is what makes Google-only kits visible. `set_rows(rows, *, palette, is_banned, allowed_kits=None, pin_view_for=None, compare_status_for=None)`. Rows store `MtoWorklistRow` in a custom role; open/copy via [`rd_catalog/path_actions.py`](rd_catalog/path_actions.py) `open_path` and the clipboard — never parsed table text. Signals: `kit_activated` (Комплекты), `kit_documents_requested` («Все документы»), `prepare_context_menu` (window injects «Передать роботу» via `_add_robot_handoff_action`). Header `window/mto_worklist_header_v4` (do not restore `window/mto_worklist_header_v3`, `window/mto_worklist_header_v2` or `window/mto_worklist_header`), Interactive. Refresh wherever the heatmap refreshes (`refresh`, ban, palette, skip-dir). Bulk copy of MTO files to a folder is out of scope; `iter_mto_files_for_cells` and `list_mto_worklist` are read APIs, and this tab is their GUI.

## АН (авторский надзор dump finder)

Dump index only — not a catalog source. **Locked contract** (do not reopen):

- No `SourceKind.AN`. Dump files are **not** in `file_entry`, overlay, «Все документы», collisions, pipeline, READY, `kit_package`.
- Do not patch [`rd_catalog/scan.py`](rd_catalog/scan.py) / `scan_job.py` / `execute_scan` / `store_scan` / `build_rd_overlays` for АН.
- Full catalog scan does **not** walk АН. Button **«Сканировать АН»** on the АН tab only.
- After АН scan: refresh АН tab + Комплекты column «АН МТО» only — **no** `rebuild_pipeline`, no document tree rebuild.
- Compare АН filename rev to **Авто МТО / MTO РД filename** (`_auto_mto_rd_target`: heatmap/export selection → pin → **MTO in the official issued folder**, not working overlay-current and not an older NN), **not** overlay «РД · рев.» (OD wins ties — misleading for MTO). Filename of that MTO may lag OD (`03` copied into the `04` package). No MTO in that folder → «нет MTO РД».
- Tab columns **vs Авто МТО** / **vs MTO РД** keep `да`/`нет`/`—` from `revision_texts_match`, then append a content grade in parentheses when the counterpart xlsx exists: `(четкое)` / `(ПоКоду и Кол-ву)` / `(не совпало)` / `(не сверялось)`. Same grades as «Сверка Авто МТО» (`compare_mto_pair`). Other vs-* stay revision-only. Queue is in [`rd_catalog/an_tab.py`](rd_catalog/an_tab.py) and starts only while the АН tab is visible; cache `runtime_dir/an_content_compare_cache.json`. Not in `_busy()`. АН scan still does **not** open workbooks or Word files. Content compare is **xlsx only** — OD vs-* stay revision-only.
- `02` and `02-AN01` are **not** equivalent (`revision_texts_match`).
- `closes_auto_mto`: Auto MTO nonempty AND Auto MTO does not match MTO РД AND АН has an **MTO** file whose parsed rev matches Auto MTO (OD rows do not close). Stem match preferred; title+mark+rev without stem still closes with tooltip `ствол не совпал`. Kit `match_an_to_kit` prefers MTO for the shown file; OD-only kits still show the OD filename rev.
- File `_02_RU.xlsx` in АН is catalog-side contrast, **not** closing PI `02-AN01`.
- «не совпало» = content mismatch, not “not transferred”. «рев. совпала» = names match, content not compared yet.
- Issuance target on kits АН uses **effective** latest (`row.issuance` / `latest_effective_issuance_kits`), same as «Выдача · рев.».
- No UNC writes from this feature. User copies files into the canonical RD tree manually and rescans.

