## Overlay and review

- Transfer folders contain deltas. Walk newest to oldest by **sequence, then filename revision, then file mtime**. Sequence is the issuance order: folder ``10`` with filename ``04`` stays current over folder ``09`` with ``04-AN01`` (the AN01 package may never have gone to the customer). Flag those inversions for a human: kit summary **«Проверить передачи»** only for **MTO and OD** (WIR/LAY/other marks stay on the collisions tab), collisions ``TRANSFER_ORDER_CONFLICT`` (later folder, lower file rev) and ``TRANSFER_MTIME_CONFLICT`` (later folder, older file mtime). The same summary also fires when the official (non-working) NN is not the closest to letter A (else send date) among same-rev packages, or its MTO/OD mtime is more than 7 days after that letter — even without an NN inversion. Open-folder / «РД · рев.» stay on the official highest NN; «РД · рев.» paints mismatch yellow and the tooltip has the package table (editable MTO/OD only: xlsx/xls/dwg, not PDF copies of MTO; OD PDF only when the disputed kit has no editable file). Сверка MTO pairs workbooks, never PDF. Duplicate ``NN`` under one gate compete by filename revision; if revisions are equal, later file mtime wins. Two copies **inside the same** package (same transfer + same filename revision) stay `DUP_SAME_REVISION` (collision remains visible); **the later mtime stays overlay-current** so a leftover nested copy cannot hide the issued file.
- Missing keys in a newer delta remain current from older transfers. SQ never participates in RD overlay.
- Overlay `detected_current` stays objective newest (may be a working package). Review is separate (`pending|acknowledged|ignored`). Ignoring requires a comment. Kits current / export / RD↔robot compare / Auto MTO target / «Открыть содержащую папку · РД» / worklist package path / jump to «Все документы» use `official_detected_current_ids` / `official_rd_mto_overlay` / `pick_official_rd_package` in [`rd_catalog/pipeline.py`](rd_catalog/pipeline.py), not the working head and not `kit_package.is_current` when a later delta NN sits between official and working. Promotion is by **issued package** (highest filename rev in that folder), not by leftover files inside the working folder that still carry `official_revision_text`. Working is the folder name, not every `NN_` with that number: ``10_SQ-…`` with ``01-AN01`` stays official when ``10_рев.…_as built`` is working. Documents tree «Текущая» can still be the working package.
- Present RD files whose **filename title** differs from the **title folder**, or whose **filename mark** is not hosted by the **mark folder**, stay in the catalog (not dropped). ``SOS`` vs ``SOT`` is mixed; ``06_KSB_21`` still hosts ``KSB`` / ``KSB1``. Комплекты **Сводка** «Смешанные титулы» (after «Нет в РД», before «Проверить передачи»). «РД · рев.» fill palette `mixed_titles` (soft red); tooltip lists foreign title\\mark folders. Missing-transfer grey still wins over that red. WEB uses the same `monitor_views` cells. Point **«Пересканировать РД»** (and documents-tree folder rescan for that title–mark) also walks the foreign title/mark folders; after you fix the files on disk, missing detection can set `present=0` without a full RD scan. Kits context **«Открыть смешанные папки»** opens the parent of each stray file (``PDF`` / ``DWG`` / ``NN_…``), one Explorer window per unique folder — not the foreign mark folder.
- First successful scan establishes the baseline; only later add/change/missing events become pending.
- Ambiguous duplicates, parse failures of names that **match** the AGCC mask, and transfer-order conflicts are non-fatal and must remain visible. Names that do not match the mask are not catalog files and must not appear in the document tree.

## MTO comparison

- Compare current RD MTO XLSX with robot MTO by the MTO key. Current RD MTO is `official_rd_mto_overlay`, not raw `reconstruct_current_rd_mto_overlay`.
- Canonical row fields are exactly `CODE, UNITS, VALUES, TAGS, NAME, VENDOR, TYPE_MARK`; preserve every material row (do not aggregate by CODE) and compare as a multiset independent of row order.
- Content differences are `WARNING`, not blocking. Missing/duplicate/unreadable/compare-error pairs are `BLOCKED`.
- Comparison must be side-effect-free and versioned by `MTO_COMPARE_ALGORITHM_VERSION`; do not call report-writing `two_mto_compare` from scans.
- Scan never reads XLSX for content-diff. After a successful RD and/or ROBOT persist, the GUI auto-enqueues a **deferred** incremental compare (`python -m rd_catalog.mto_compare_cli`, `MtoCompareThread`). SQ-only scan does not enqueue. The same compare (plus Auto MTO `другой файл`) is also enqueued when the **official issued-folder RD MTO path** moves (`_sync_official_rd_mto_compares` after Комплекты paint; first paint diffs vs `auto_mto_compare_cache.json`, later paints vs the last worklist overlay). Startup hydrate is `_busy()` during that paint — leftover keys resume via `_resume_pending_mto_compare` after `_startup_load_running` clears. Stat-aware cache (`mto_pair_cache_valid` / `MTO_COMPARE_ALGORITHM_VERSION`) skips unchanged pairs. No user checkbox.

