## Автоперескан

Toolbar checkbox **«Автоперескан»** (`window/auto_refresh_enabled`, default on) and the label beside it (`выкл` / `ждёт` / `Google…` / `список РД…` / `перескан <папка>`). Journal lines start with `Автоперескан:`. Not on WEB.

- First pass is 75 minutes after startup hydrate, then every 75 minutes, and only while the catalog is idle. The timer does not walk UNC or redraw the table by itself.
- Google: the same two CSV exports as «Загрузить комплекты Google». Unchanged fingerprint skips ingest and `refresh()`. A change ingests and refreshes. Does not cancel the RD↔robot MTO compare.
- RD: child process `python -m rd_catalog.rd_freshness_cli` lists canonical AGCC files (skip-dirs, no xlsx/pdf reads) and compares **size and mtime** with present RD rows (`disk_mtime_ns`). Dirty mark folders, at most 4 per cycle, then the usual point scan (`start_scan`, mark folder, never the RD root). A cancelled listing does not treat missing files as deletions. No present RD snapshot → no listing and no full scan.
- Auto MTO read error «файла нет» (`needs_auto_mto_compare` is false for kind `error`) does not requeue that path. If the checkbox is on and the target is not a pin, the kit mark folder is queued immediately. After that scan, a file that is still absent stays `present=0` and is not compared; a file that is present again is compared once. A pin on a missing path is logged and not rescanned.

## GUI and threading

- Default view is **Комплекты** (first tab, active on first open); next is **Ревизии MTO** (title–mark × filename-rev heatmap); then **MTO · Перечень** (flat per-revision worklist); then **«АН»** (dump finder, smoke index **3**); then **«РД»** (RD-tree MTO xlsx dump, **АН+1**); then **MTO · Готовность робота** (`READY/WARNING/BLOCKED`); then **«MTO · Правки робота»** (`readiness+1`); then **«Выгрузка комплектов»** (`readiness+2`); then **«Выдача · Журнал»** (`readiness+3`); then **«Письма о согласовании»** (`documents−1`; after the MTO cluster + АН + РД dump + journal, before «Все документы» — smoke indexes 0/1/2 stay); all documents/history is secondary.
- Startup shows the window first (`QTimer(0)` `_startup_load` → [`StartupHydrateThread`](rd_catalog/startup_hydrate.py)). SQLite `list_*`, Google snapshot (DB, else JSON cache), kit matrix, worklist data, Auto MTO index, and AN index (`an_by_kit`) run **off the GUI thread**. First Комплекты paint applies that snapshot; it does **not** `ingest_google_snapshot`+`rebuild_pipeline` unless derived tables are empty (`list_kit_pipelines` empty while file rows or Google data exist) **or** `pipeline_algorithm_needs_rebuild` (`algorithm_version` < `PIPELINE_STATUS_ALGORITHM_VERSION`). Heatmap, export resolve, MTO tables, collisions, approval lookups, and «Все документы» tree fill on **first visit** to that tab (not a second `QTimer(0)`). After Комплекты is filled, `_busy()` is false even if those tabs are still pending. As-build IFC tooltip on Комплекты reads `MtoWorklistRow.is_current_ifc`, not a full file walk.
- UNC **scan** runs in a **child process** (`python -m rd_catalog.scan_cli`): walk + persist only. It does **not** read MTO XLSX for content-diff. The Qt `ScanThread` only pumps JSON stdout so the GUI GIL stays free. Preserve the last successful snapshot after a partial scan. After a folder-scoped robot rescan, deferred MTO compare is limited to pairs in that folder (`document_keys` / `touched_mto_keys`). After SQ→RD move, the RD rescan is the kit **gate** (`Для передачи`, sibling ``NN_рев`` packages) and SQ is the old kit folder; overlay is rebuilt from **all** present RD files so other kits stay current. Documents-tree context menu **«Пересканировать эту папку»** uses the same `rd_subtree` walk (title / mark / `NN_` common parent under `rd_root`). Kits context menu **«Пересканировать РД»** walks the kit **mark folder** when it exists, else the **title** folder (`rd_root / <титул>`). Never a gate (`Для передачи`) and never the RD root. If present RD files of that kit sit under another title (MIXED_TITLES), the same point scan also walks those foreign **title/mark** folders (`rd_root / 2612 / 05_KSB`) so missing detection can clear files you already moved or deleted there; mixed files are not dropped from the catalog while they remain on disk. `rd_subtree` may be a list; missing detection is the union of those folders.
- **АН scan** is a separate child process (`python -m rd_catalog.an_scan_cli`, Qt pump `AnScanThread`). Not `scan_cli`. In `_catalog_workers_busy` / `_busy()`. Must not overlap scan / РД dump / Google / robot / SQ→RD. Start cancels deferred RD↔robot MTO compare (same as Google). After finish: `_reload_an_index` + kits «АН МТО» paint + `an_tab.set_rows` — no `rebuild_pipeline`, no document tree.
- **РД dump scan** is a separate child process (`python -m rd_catalog.rd_dump_scan_cli`, Qt pump `RdDumpScanThread`). Not `scan_cli`. In `_catalog_workers_busy` / `_busy()`. Must not overlap scan / АН / Google / robot / SQ→RD. Start cancels deferred RD↔robot MTO compare. After finish: `_reload_rd_dump_index` + `rd_dump_tab.set_rows` — no `rebuild_pipeline`, no kits column, no document tree.
- **MTO content compare** is a separate low-priority child process (`python -m rd_catalog.mto_compare_cli`, Windows `BELOW_NORMAL_PRIORITY_CLASS`). Auto-enqueue after a successful RD/ROBOT scan (`compare_enqueue_scope` `full`/`subtree`) **and** when the official RD MTO path changes (`_sync_official_rd_mto_compares`; heatmap may still be deferred). `none` (SQ-only / failed source) still `_resume_pending_mto_compare` so leftover keys are not stranded. GUI auto-enqueue (`_enqueue_mto_compare`) must not join `official_rd_mto_overlay` / `build_mto_compare_plan` on the GUI thread — the child job already plans. Path-change detection uses in-memory `rd_mto_overlay_by_kit`, not that join. Incremental plan: `rd_catalog/mto_compare_queue.py` omits cache-valid pairs; priority = keys from the last walk. Starting a scan / АН scan / РД dump scan / Google load / robot copy / SQ→RD / skip-prune **cancels** the MTO job (`request_cancel`, no GUI `wait`). Leftover keys merge into `_mto_pending_keys` and restart after that worker (scan/robot/SQ via the follow-up scan; Google, АН, and skip-prune via `_resume_pending_mto_compare`). If resume cannot start because the old thread is still finishing, keep `_mto_resume_on_idle`. User **Отмена** while only MTO is running cancels without auto-restart. `_busy()` does **not** include the MTO thread — scan stays available. Status bar shows `MTO сверка: i/N`; MTO tab badge `Сверка: идёт` while the thread runs, `в очереди` only when `_mto_pending_keys` or `_mto_queued` is set, else `актуально`. Overlay MTO without a cache row stays a synthetic `not_compared` placeholder (`Сверка выполняется…` while the job runs). Kits robot cell: if content cache is missing, tooltip «Сверка MTO ещё не завершена; показано по дате файла» (`mto_content_equal_by_kit` ignores `not_compared`). On MTO job done, refresh MTO table + kits robot paint only — do not rebuild the document tree or pipeline.
- **Авто МТО content compare** is a different queue from RD↔robot. Enqueue whenever the painted status is `не сверялось` / `рев. совпала` / `другой файл` (`needs_auto_mto_compare`): heatmap/export resolve, `apply_export_selections` (pin / rule / target), cache hydrate, startup overlay (Комплекты, heatmap still deferred), `_sync_official_rd_mto_compares` when the official folder MTO path moved, and `_reload_auto_mto_index`. Same RD path as the cell (`selection.source_path`, else pin, else **MTO in the official issued folder** — filename may lag OD; older NN not searched). Sequential `AutoMtoCompareThread` (one kit). Not `mto_compare_cli`. `_busy()` does **not** include it; scan/Google stay available. The next kit pauses while a catalog worker is busy. Label on «Ревизии MTO»: `Авто МТО сверка: i/N`. Persist `single`/`composite`/`no_match` plus `grade` in `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Documentation_PDF_out_NK\rd_catalog\auto_mto_compare_cache.json` ([`rd_catalog/auto_mto_compare_cache.py`](rd_catalog/auto_mto_compare_cache.py)); key = kit + RD path + scan `mtime_ns` + AutoMTO fingerprints + algorithm (`AUTO_MTO_COMPARE_ALGORITHM_VERSION = 2`). Path identity for stale/cache hit is `auto_mto_rd_paths_match` (Unicode dashes + `make_path_key`), not raw `casefold`. Hydrate prefers a cache hit for the **current** RD path; an older kit entry only remains as `другой файл`. A new target for the same kit **replaces** other queued paths; if a running job finishes for the old file, the current path is enqueued. Manual «Сверить Авто МТО…» prepends. Context menu stays enabled while the queue runs.
- A cancelled walk or a failed **source/subtree root** skips missing detection (stale `present=1` stays). Nested `os.walk` errors on other folders must **not** freeze the rest of the source: files outside those error paths that were not seen are marked `present=0`. Overlay then rebuilds from remaining present RD rows. Default «Все документы» tree shows **present** files; missing rows appear with «Требует проверки» / «Только проблемы».
- Google kits export runs in its own worker thread and must not overlap an active UNC scan.
- KSB ИД F/D/E write (`GoogleFWriteThread` in [`rd_catalog/google_f_write_thread.py`](rd_catalog/google_f_write_thread.py)) must not overlap a scan / АН scan / РД dump scan / Google load / robot copy / SQ→RD / heatmap export copy. Комплекты **«D/E из журнала F…»** идёт тем же потоком и `JournalWriteJob`, что **«Письма о согласовании»**, без второго Sheets-писателя. Documents-tree **«Легализовать согласование РД (F)…»** likewise: one `JournalWriteJob` from [`legalize_approval_f_line`](rd_catalog/f_legalize.py) after the F до/F после dialog. After writes the same thread re-fetches **КСБ ИД** only (`fetch_google_kits(..., include_issuance=False)`); «Выдача РД ПД» stays on the issuance JSON cache (GUI falls back to in-memory `_issuance_sends` if that cache is empty — never ingest empty sends over a live snapshot). `execute_journal_writes` plans chained letters in memory and sends **one** `values:batchUpdate` per kit (different kits stay separate HTTP calls). The GUI `ingest_google_snapshot` then `rebuild_pipeline(kit_keys=written ∪ changed_google_kit_keys)` and refreshes Комплекты (`official_detected_current_ids` + `build_kit_matrix` — working vs official depends on F). It must **not** call full `refresh()`: no `list_files`, documents tree, heatmap paint, issuance journal, or MTO readiness; those tabs stay deferred like keep_view. Heatmap `set_export_records` uses contour records (`_pipeline_records()`), not the full catalog snapshot. Approval-mail `_rebuild` caches parsed `.msg`; re-parse only when `kit_from_transmittal` identity changes. `_busy()` includes this thread. Preview uses SQLite `comment_raw`; the write re-reads live F once for the batch. Widget: [`rd_catalog/approval_mail_tab.py`](rd_catalog/approval_mail_tab.py) (no confirm dialog; written rows stay marked until a successful F write, then the tab auto-removes written and «уже в F» like «Убрать записанные» («только D/E» and errors stay); Delete / «Удалить выбранные» / «Убрать записанные» still work. Ingest log: button **«Открыть лог»** opens ``runtime_dir/approval_mail_ingest.log`` (тема и текст). Button row: **«Записать в Google»** stays, neighbouring actions are spaced away from it). Outlook DnD first reads `FileGroupDescriptorW` + indexed `FileContents`. Qt often returns 0 bytes because Outlook serves ``.msg`` as OLE ``IStorage``; re-read the live ``IDataObject`` (IStorage / IStream / HGLOBAL) via the ``RegisterDragDrop`` hook in [`rd_catalog/outlook_ole.py`](rd_catalog/outlook_ole.py). Install that hook in ``CatalogWindow`` before ``setAcceptDrops``. If OLE is also empty, use exact dragged-item IDs from `RenPrivateMessages` and `Namespace.GetItemFromID` / `SaveAs` olMSGUnicode ([`rd_catalog/outlook_item.py`](rd_catalog/outlook_item.py)), never `ActiveExplorer().Selection`. Dump MIME sizes, OLE note, and RenPrivate parse hex ([`rd_catalog/approval_mail_dump.py`](rd_catalog/approval_mail_dump.py)). Parser repairs CP1251-as-Latin-1 `.msg` bodies and prefers HTML when it has more review-code tails or a restored Cyrillic cover table ([`rd_catalog/approval_mail.py`](rd_catalog/approval_mail.py)). Capital Projects «Notification of Transmittal» document rows accept IFC numeric/AN/`V`/`S` **and** old IFR letter revisions (`\ A \`). Outgoing «Сопроводительное письмо» (Owner Document Number table / attached transmittals, not `RE:`) is `cover_letter` / `tdo_sent` — F line is ``DD.MM.YYYY отпр на ТДО рев. 01-AN01 TRM`` (`format_history_line` writes ``рев. X`` for non-code stages; codes stay ``на рев. X``). A cover without that table still takes Russian prose ``по титулу 8950 марка SOO2 рев.03`` (same `_pick_kit_prose` as TDO). F-line suffix at the end: ``MTO <rev|Нет> [auto]`` (never ``MTO рев. X``); [`parse_history_line`](rd_catalog/kits.py) fills `mto_revision` / `mto_absent` / `from_robot_auto`. Catalog writes ([`approval_mail.py`](rd_catalog/approval_mail.py) `_catalog_f_line`) always append ``auto``. Notification/cover: MTO from letter documents (discipline starts with `mto`), else ``MTO Нет``. TDO reply: MTO only if a document stem is present, never ``MTO Нет``. When those stems have no ``_rev`` tail, ``_fill_revisions_from_cover_table`` copies Owner Document Number revisions from the quoted cover (first filename wins; reviewer text like ``повысить до 01-AN02`` is not OD). Empty stems stay empty — do not replace them with cover rows. F до/F после yellow-mark only the character diff of that row (`journal_highlight_spans` / `journal_diff_html`), including chained/cumulative letters for the same kit; do not wash the whole after-cell. `RE:` stays `tdo_reply`. Explorer ``.msg`` / folder of files also work; checkbox **«Обходить подпапки»** (`window/approval_mail_subfolders`, default off) walks nested directories for «Папка с .msg…» and Explorer folder drops. Drop on the catalog window switches to this tab (`ApprovalMailDropFilter`). Outlook and the catalog must run at the same integrity level. Table context menu: **«Текст письма…»** (subject + decoded body + error; double-click on an error row opens it) and **«Дамп Outlook…»** / copy / save — MIME formats, saved `.msg`, `extract_msg` subject/body/HTML, parser fields ([`rd_catalog/approval_mail_dump.py`](rd_catalog/approval_mail_dump.py)). TDO replies without filenames in the top take a unique AGCC stem from the quoted thread (including a ``_0_RU`` tail without extension), else Russian prose ``по титулу 6816 марка KSB рев.0`` (``марка`` may wrap), else issuance TRM, else parent folder ``1600-SOT`` ([`kit_hint_from_path`](rd_catalog/approval_mail.py)). When that revision is known, F is ``DD.MM.YYYY прошла вх контр рев. 0 TRM`` — same ``рев. X`` as a cover letter. Several letters for the same kit append F by date (`apply_history_line`); a same-date **truncated stub** (date-only, or date + TRM without a classified stage) is replaced by the fuller classified line when revision/TRM do not conflict — a free-form note on that date is not eaten, and a different classified stage still inserts. The write applies jobs in order against one in-memory A:F matrix.
- Robot MTO copy/replace runs in its own worker thread and must not overlap a scan or Google load.
- SQ→RD folder move runs in its own worker thread and must not overlap a scan, Google load, or robot MTO copy.
- Skip-dir DB prune (`apply_skip_dirs`) is in-process SQLite (no UNC) and must not overlap a scan, Google load, robot copy, or SQ→RD move.
- Match PDF v2 file UX: double-click opens, **except Комплекты**: the kits matrix and kit-card package table use a read-only editor on double-click so the user can select/copy cell text; they do **not** open files. Open / folder / copy stay on the context menu and buttons (including «Открыть файл · Авто МТО»).
- Resolve actions from row IDs/DB paths, not truncated table text; missing paths disable actions without crashing.
- Context-menu usage tracking must stay off the click I/O path: `exec_tracked_menu` only applies the cached bold set and `note()`s in memory. JSON write/re-read is the 2-minute timer or `shutdown_context_menu_usage` on close.
- After scan and after Google load the GUI calls `rebuild_pipeline` (SQLite only, no UNC). Do not overlap that rebuild with an active scan / Google / robot / SQ→RD worker; `refresh` after those workers finish is the rebuild point.
- **Комплекты paint** uses in-memory `_kits_monitor_row_for` (records / pipelines / worklist / AN index already on the window). Do **not** call `load_catalog_monitor` from `_refresh_kits_table` — that join rebuilds journal + heatmap DTO + AN scores (~10s) for WEB/other tabs. Kit card uses `get_kit_card`.
- **keep_view** scoped scan (Пересканировать РД, робот MTO) passes `defer_secondary=True`: heatmap / journal / MTO readiness / tree stay deferred until the user opens that tab. Documents-tree folder rescan still rebuilds the tree (`stay_on_documents`). SQ→RD keep_view defers the tree like robot MTO (`rebuild_document_tree=False`); first visit / «Показать в Все документы» fills it once (`_ensure_deferred_widget` / `_jump_to_kit_documents`). АН tab is deferred the same way (`_DEFERRED_AN`); РД dump tab (`_DEFERRED_RD_DUMP`) likewise; `_refresh_kits_table` must not rebuild them. After keep_view refresh still call `_schedule_auto_mto_compares`.
- After RD↔robot MTO compare (`_refresh_mto_related`) and Auto MTO compare finish: repaint Комплекты with `rebuild_rows=False` (update `_mto_content_by_kit` only). Do not rebuild the kit matrix or reload the monitor. Paint «MTO · Готовность» only while that tab is visible; otherwise keep it deferred.
- After `list_files`, compute the canonical contour **once** (`records_in_contour`) and pass those rows into `rebuild_pipeline` / `list_mto_worklist` / `build_kit_matrix` with `rd_root=None`. Do not walk `record_has_canonical_layout` again on the same refresh. A later refresh **reuses** contour membership for unchanged `id`/path/source. Startup worker puts `contour_records` and `official_current_ids` on the snapshot — the GUI must not recompute them. File-only scans reuse `_issuance_kits` (journal / Google ingest refresh that cache). `_official_current_ids` is memoized until records / overlay ids / pipelines change. `official_detected_current_ids` / `official_rd_mto_overlay` index files **once** by kit, then look only at that kit’s working packages. `official_rd_mto_overlay(..., records=)` must not call `list_files` again when the window already holds the catalog. Before `hydrate_auto_mto_compare_cache` on Комплекты startup, `seed_rd_mtimes` from catalog rows — do not `stat` UNC workbooks on the GUI thread.
- **Профилирование подвисаний и scope refresh** (в т.ч. «Пометить папку как рабочую» / «аннулированную»): [AI_rd_catalog_perf.mdc](.cursor/rules/AI_rd_catalog_perf.mdc). Не дублировать таблицу `elapsed_ms` здесь.
- **Layout persistence (QSettings `Documentation_PDF_out_NK` / `rd_catalog`):** window geometry (size/position/maximized) via `saveGeometry`/`restoreGeometry`; splitter states for documents (`window/doc_splitter`) and комплекты (`window/kits_splitter` when details are bottom, `window/kits_splitter_h` when right; placement `window/kits_detail_placement`, default `bottom`; do not restore the other orientation’s key onto the live splitter); комплекты detail tab index (`window/kits_detail_tab_v2` — do not restore `window/kits_detail_tab`); horizontal header state (column widths / order) for MTO, **MTO · Перечень** (`window/mto_worklist_header_v4` — do not restore `window/mto_worklist_header_v3`, `window/mto_worklist_header_v2` or `window/mto_worklist_header`), Комплекты (`window/kits_header_v10` — do not restore `window/kits_header_v9`; fallback template [`rd_catalog/kits_table_layout.json`](rd_catalog/kits_table_layout.json) / `runtime_dir/kits_table_layout.json` via **«Сохранить шаблон колонок»**). After restoring the kits header, default sort is **Титул** ascending (early numbers first); Qt’s header default is descending, and old `kits_header_v10` may still store that — `_apply_default_kits_title_sort` overrides when the sort column is still Титул. Коллизии, history under «Все документы» (`window/history_header_v8` — do not restore `window/history_header_v7`). Those tables use `Interactive` column resize (not `ResizeToContents`). Persist on close (`sync()`); restore on startup. Do not reset those column widths on `refresh()`. **Ревизии MTO** is the exception: title/mark/export/«РД · рев.»/«Авто МТО»/«Сверка Авто МТО» stay Interactive; every filename-revision column uses `Stretch` so the full set fits the viewport with **no horizontal scrollbar** (narrow columns elide, tooltip keeps the rev text). Header click sorts (not stored in QSettings). Do not persist heatmap header widths (`window/rev_matrix_header`) — the column set is data-dependent. The kit-card packages table is the same exception (`Stretch` + `ResizeToContents`; do not persist). Filter checkboxes on «Ревизии MTO» persist under `window/rev_matrix_*`; worklist filters `window/mto_worklist_*`; issuance-journal header `window/issuance_journal_header_v1` and filters `window/issuance_journal_*`; АН header `window/an_tab_header_v3` (do not restore `window/an_tab_header_v2` or `window/an_tab_header_v1`) and filters `window/an_tab_*`; РД dump header `window/rd_dump_tab_header_v2` (do not restore `window/rd_dump_tab_header_v1`) and filters `window/rd_dump_tab_*`; Комплекты filters `window/kits_filter_*`; approval-mail subfolder walk `window/approval_mail_subfolders`.

### Все документы

- Tree: title → mark → transfer/directory node. Default label is the **highest filename revision** among files in that folder (OD wins ties), then the latest save date in parentheses (`01-AN02 (2024.08.16)`). Date is the newest local mtime of PDF / MTO XLSX / source-editable files in that folder (AGCC mask only). «Без ревизии» only when no file in the folder has a filename revision/AN; the date still appends when known. Do not split the tree by each file's own revision. Do not show files without a parsed title and mark (no «Без титула» dump for non-AGCC names). Hide any record whose **parent path** matches current `skip_dirs` (same matcher as the scan).
- Extra label fields on the documents tab («В узле ревизии»): checkboxes persist in QSettings (`window/doc_tree_show_*`). Options: **Статус MTO** (first in the row; default **on** — the only extra besides Дата that is; `window/doc_tree_show_mto_status`; `MTO: <short status>` first among extras; 12px heatmap-palette square `color_for(palette, mto_status or "empty")`; bold when `problem_kinds` are non-empty; underline when `is_current_mto`; icons in `_mto_icon_cache`, cleared by `_reload_status_colors`, which also rebuilds the tree), **Дата** (default on), **Папка NN** (issued folder name `05_рев.0-AN02_…`), **Статус Google** (compact **review** badge for that folder only when a `kit_cycle` matched via TRM / revision / date ±2 days; otherwise omitted — do not invent «не в СР»; not the approval letter), **Текущая** (overlay `detected_current`; a different question from MTO actuality), **MTO** (MTO XLSX in the folder), **Рабочая** (`window/doc_tree_show_working` is leftover; the word ``рабочая`` is **always** in the node when `hint.is_working` — manual `kit_working_flag` or filename rev strictly above last send/F). The word ``аннулирована`` is **always** in the node when `hint.is_annulled` (manual `kit_annulled_flag` **or** NN folder name contains ``Void``; no hide checkbox). Working nodes take palette fill `working`; annulled nodes take `annulled` (wins over working if both exist; not over layout-mismatch yellow). «Статус MTO» is the Google F / heatmap cell for that **filename rev** and does **not** become «рабочая» when a sibling official folder still has the same rev with code A. **As-build** (`AB` when any file in the folder has `is_as_build`). Folder name / Google status / current / MTO / as-build stay off until the user enables them. Hover the node for the full dump even when checkboxes are off (MTO tooltip lines ignore the checkbox; working tooltip names manual vs auto; annulled tooltip says the folder is out of official / working contest / compare). Soft-yellow layout-mismatch background and purple/red pending/problem foreground are applied **before** the MTO icon/font and are not overwritten; working then annulled fill run after mismatch so mismatch still wins. `DocumentTreeLabelOptions.show_mto_status`; `folder_tree_label(..., mto_label="", is_annulled=False)`; `folder_tree_tooltip(..., mto_status_label="", mto_revision_text="", mto_problems="", working_origin="", is_annulled=False)`. [`rd_catalog/doc_bundle.py`](rd_catalog/doc_bundle.py) stays Qt-free and does not import `status_colors`; the caller passes the formatted label. GUI reads `list_folder_tree_hints`; it must not parse Google CSV. Folder-mark semantics (working vs annulled vs journal `annulled`): [AI_rd_catalog_db.mdc](.cursor/rules/AI_rd_catalog_db.mdc) § Working / Annulled folder.
- New RD scans do not add those nodes. Leftover non-canonical `file_entry` rows are deleted on startup / `store_scan`. Canonical `NN_` packages stay unpainted.
- Tab buttons: **Skip-папки…** opens [`rd_catalog/skip_dirs_dialog.py`](rd_catalog/skip_dirs_dialog.py) (add / edit / delete / up-down / А→Я; Save writes `skip_dirs.json`). **Убрать skip из дерева** walks SQLite only (`CatalogDatabase.apply_skip_dirs`): mark present RD/SQ rows under skipped dirs as `present=0`, do **not** set PENDING / do not insert review events / do not create a scan_run / do not walk UNC; rebuild overlay from remaining present RD files. Robot untouched. Restore pruned files only via a full RD/SQ scan. Must not overlap an active scan / Google load / robot copy / SQ→RD move.
- Click revision: table of all documents in that folder, including editables without PDF. Column **«Дата»** (after «Имя») is the newest file mtime in that row (`YYYY.MM.DD`, PDF / MTO / DWG); the latest date in the selected folder is pale-blue `#DCEEFF`. Column «Рев.» (after «Дата») is that document's filename revision; column **AB** after «Рев.» is as-build (`Да`/`Нет` from `is_as_build`); column **«Рабочая»** after AB (`Да`/`Нет`, palette `working`; tooltip names manual vs auto); column **«Аннул.»** after «Рабочая» (`Да`/`Нет`, palette `annulled`); column **«Ручной выбор MTO»** after «Аннул.»; column **«Статус MTO»** after the pin (heatmap palette via `_paint_pipeline_cell` — Google F for the filename rev, not the working-folder mark).
- Columns: document, type, PDF yes/no, Ред yes/no (+exts), current overlay for PDF, presence, name, **Дата**, filename rev, as-build, **Рабочая**, **Аннул.**, Ручной выбор MTO, Статус MTO, «Путь комплекта» (`issued_package_dir`: `NN_…` package folder, never `…\PDF\file.pdf`; index 14). Header key `window/history_header_v8` (do not restore `window/history_header_v7`).
- Tree context: open folder, copy folder path, **«Пересканировать эту папку»** (`start_scan(..., rd_subtree=)`), **«Передать роботу»** (copy a chat dump: node kind, current label text, checkbox state, Google hint, package folder, file paths). On a **revision node**: **«Пометить папку как рабочую»** (checkable when a manual flag exists) / **«Снять пометку «рабочая»»** (identity is the issued NN folder, not the filename revision). Unmark only for **manual** flags; auto (disk > last send) cannot be unmarked (tooltip). Same node: **«Пометить папку как аннулированную»** / **«Снять пометку «аннулирована»»** (`kit_annulled_flag`; unmarkable unless the NN name contains ``Void`` — then scan owns the mark). Marking working deletes annulled on that folder and vice versa. Annulled folders stay visible but drop out of official / auto-working / transfer contests / heatmap overlay-collision join — [AI_rd_catalog_db.mdc](.cursor/rules/AI_rd_catalog_db.mdc). Same node: **«Легализовать согласование РД (F)…»** ([`rd_catalog/f_legalize.py`](rd_catalog/f_legalize.py) / [`rd_catalog/f_legalize_dialog.py`](rd_catalog/f_legalize_dialog.py)) — dialog **F до** (read-only) / **F после** (editable, prefilled). Line is `catalog_f_line` **code A** like «Письма о согласовании» (`legalize_approval_f_line`); date = folder mtime; OD rev of the node; MTO from the folder xlsx else ``MTO Нет``; TRM placeholder ``Добавлен_для_легализации_ревизии`` (not a real TRM). Write is the same `GoogleFWriteThread` / `execute_journal_writes`. Kit must already exist in КСБ ИД. Same node: **«Легализовать ревизию РД (Выдача)…»** — same journal dialog as Комплекты (`open_legalize_rd_dialog`), but revision/date come from **this folder**, not official kit «РД · рев.». Not WEB. History context: open PDF/editables, **copy «Имя»**, **copy «Путь комплекта»**, copy full file paths, **«Передать роботу»**; on an MTO xlsx row **«Заменить дату на дату последнего кода A/B/C»** / **«Заменить дату вручную…»** / **«Заменить дату на среднюю по папке»** / **«Сбросить дату каталога»** (`file_mtime_override`; folder mean = disk dates of other files in the selected revision node, excluding this document). Ctrl+C on the history table copies the current column when it is «Имя», «Дата» or «Путь комплекта». The same **«Передать роботу»** item is on комплекты / package / MTO / worklist / collision context menus.
- Kits context menu: jump to that title–mark in «Все документы», select the **official** issued `NN` (not the working head). Jump hides via the title–mark filter (`_sync_document_tree_filter_hidden`) and selects that official (or given) NN; first visit still fills the deferred tree once. **«Пересканировать РД»**: scoped `start_scan(..., rd_subtree=)` of the kit **mark folder** when that directory exists (`rd_root / <титул> / <папка марки>`). A gate (`Для передачи`, `03_Для передачи`, …) is never the subtree. If the mark folder is missing, walk the **title** folder (`rd_root / <титул>`) — do not refuse, do not climb to `rd_root`. Resolve mark from canonical RD paths (`unique_kit_rd_mark_folders`, gates skipped), else a unique live `folder_matches_mark` child, else constructed `rd_root / title / mark`. When the kit has mixed-title RD files, also walk the foreign **title/mark** folders recovered from those paths (`mixed_title_rescan_folders`); still never the RD root. **«Открыть смешанные папки»** opens the parent of each stray file (``PDF`` / ``DWG`` / ``NN_…``), one Explorer window per unique folder. Stays on Комплекты (`keep_view`, `restore_kit`). Disabled while `_busy()`. Overlay still rebuilt from all present RD files. «Обновить MTO у робота» copies the newest **official** overlay-current RD MTO or SQ MTO (not working; higher filename revision, then later mtime) into the robot folder; confirmation dialog shows source and robot file (rev, save date, size, path). Button «Сравнить» live-reads both xlsx with the scan `mto_diff` algorithm (not the scan cache), shows a short appear/disappear/changed summary, and writes a local Excel under `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Documentation_PDF_out_NK\rd_catalog\mto_preview\` («Открыть файл сравнения»). Replace archives the old robot file into `_old_<stem>_YYYY.MM.DD_HH.MM` beside it; missing robot file is added under `robot_root/title/MARK`. After success, a **child-process robot rescan is limited to the destination folder** (`scan_catalog(..., robot_subtree=)`); missing detection and collision replace stay scoped so other robot kits are untouched. Deferred MTO compare then runs only for keys in that folder. The GUI stays on Комплекты and reselects the same title–mark row (does not switch to Журнал; document tree is not rebuilt). Full «Только MTO робота» still walks the whole robot root. **«Перенести SQ в РД (новая передача)»** (enabled when SQ files are present): confirmation dialog, worker thread, moves the SQ title+mark folder into a new gate package ``NN_рев.<rev>_от_YYYY.MM.DD``; then a scoped RD+SQ rescan (`rd_subtree` = gate «Для передачи», `sq_subtree` = old SQ folder) with keep_view on Комплекты. Overlay is rebuilt from all present RD files; document tree stays deferred until the tab is opened (keep_view on Комплекты).
- Do not create `QTreeWidgetItem` via `dict.setdefault` default arg (eager eval creates empty duplicate roots).
